{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54298","headline":"颂 二 · 克符道者","name":"颂 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"夺境不夺人，寻言何处真？问禅是禅妄，究理理非亲。\n日照寒光澹，山摇（《人天眼目》作「遥」）翠色新。\n直饶玄会得，恬似（《五灯会元》、《人天眼目》作「也是」）眼中尘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"克符道者","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54298.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54298","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}